WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:06.350
Let us now look at syntax and runtime errors
when manipulating data, which means one is

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.940
trying to insert, update, or delete data.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.549
I have a query here that is looking to add
two records to a BikeRepairs table.

00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:16.040
I will execute the query.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:20.980
There is a syntax error near the number 1.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.490
With queries, it is not hard to miss a keyword
or two at times.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.499
The VALUES keyword is missing.

00:00:28.499 --> 00:00:36.100
I will add that where it needs to go and then
execute this query again.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.790
The syntax errors are gone, but now we have
a runtime error.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:47.430
The error basically says we cannot duplicate
a primary key entry.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:56.930
I'm going to quickly add a SELECT statement
below this to select everything from the BikeRepairs

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:11.320
table, and sure enough, these two values for
BikeRepairID are already used.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:15.140
Seeing that these records have already been
entered, I do not need to run this INSERT

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.799
statement again.

00:01:16.799 --> 00:01:28.250
That said, you have now seen both syntax and
runtime errors for data manipulation queries.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:33.750
Throughout this course, you have learned how
to organize, build, enter data into, and retrieve

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.719
data from a database.

00:01:35.719 --> 00:01:40.909
With this knowledge, you are set up well for
the IT Specialist Databases exam, which, when

00:01:40.909 --> 00:01:44.649
passed, will get you the IT Specialist Databases
certification.

00:01:44.649 --> 00:01:47.139
This course will also help improve your employability.

00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:51.450
Thank you for taking this course, and good
luck with your exam.

